      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DO NOT BLINK (3) took advantage of a low draw last start with an all-the-way win (22.81) at this track in a Maiden over 400m. Has good early burn and is drawn to be prominent. Can measure up again. GYPSY SUNRISE (1) comes here off a placing in quick time (22.36) over 400m at this track when beaten 5 lengths in a Grade 5. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. WAHOO BLUE (2) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (19.78) in a Grade 5 at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Expecting another good run. CAN'T WAIT (7) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts ago but finished fourth last time (22.41) at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide.",
